#X text 20 5 All MIDI becomes 'kind ch a b': 0 note (note vel) \, 1 bend (value) \, 2 pressure \, 3 poly pressure (value note) \, 4 CC (cc value);
#X obj 20 140 s \$0-raw;
#X obj 20 30 notein;
#X obj 20 60 pack 0 0 0;
#X msg 20 90 0 \$3 \$1 \$2;
#X obj 170 30 bendin;
